# migrate/drill/target.stack: the fresh target host for the pft-migrate live drill, built by
# rebuild/pft-rebuild-drill.sh (RB_STACK=migrate/drill/target.stack ... run --keep) in its isolated LXD sandbox.
# Only the base install (Docker, compose project, image) plus age: the node identity and config arrive with the
# pft-migrate bundle, nothing is restored from a backup. The sandbox's own fresh node (random identity) is stopped by
# the drill before `import`. ORDER STEP AFTER COMMAND (format: rebuild/stack.list).
10 base - bash install.sh
20 age  base apt-get -qq install -y age >/dev/null && age --version
